## Level-mode boards — 20 pictures GENERATED by rasterizing real geometry
## (circles / rings / triangles / split-color regions) onto the hex lattice at
## the TRUE rendered bubble positions, so nothing shears across the row stagger.
## Every large region is split into 2+ colors and a keystone check guarantees
## NO single pop can clear a board (generator: tools/levelgen.py — run it,
## eyeball build/web/levels.svg, paste build/levels_out.txt back here).
## Rows: '0'-'4' = palette color, '.' = empty; even rows 11 cells, odd 10.
## tests/test_levels.gd validates lengths, characters, anchoring and a
## winnability bound vs the shot budget.
## Stars: shots_left/shots >= 0.35 -> 3, >= 0.12 -> 2, cleared -> 1.

